      ],
      "en": "Then after a period of fourteen years I went up again to Jerusalem with Barnabas, taking Titus also with me.",
      "ko": "십 사년 후에 내가 바나바와 함께 디도를 데리고 다시 예루살렘에 올라갔노니",
      "source_text_hash": "a229e2eb1e728616f323789e3745e706f3a2c856dadb5b9865e788f97249ba61",
      "translation_text_hash": "02872f75bc9022f3803fe2d90da8d947b26309a12559fb1c1ea675b50c069ed9",
