        "verse": 3
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GAL",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "But not even Titus, who was with me, being a Greek, was compelled to be circumcised.",
      "ko": "그러나 나와 함께 있는 헬라인 디도라도 억지로 할례를 받게 아니하였으니",
      "source_text_hash": "49738ab4fd58ade4fcfc2c11cf3c7eda9742d01a4464cc65c59ed313e7b3eb4c",
      "translation_text_hash": "46f660812f2c58f10744dcab74dff37936a282fd14a887acc6851f3d75f6ccaf",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그러나 나와 함께 있는 헬라인 디도라도 억지로 할례를 받게 아니하였으니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "46f660812f2c58f10744dcab74dff37936a282fd14a887acc6851f3d75f6ccaf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:GAL:2:4",
      "sequence": 29082,
      "chapter_label": "GAL 2",
      "verse_label": "4",
      "locator": {
