        "verse": 7
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GAL",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "but to the contrary, when they saw that I had been entrusted with the Good News for the uncircumcised, even as Peter with the Good News for the circumcised—",
      "ko": "도리어 내가 무할례자에게 복음 전함을 맡기를 베드로가 할례자에게 맡음과 같이 한 것을 보고",
      "source_text_hash": "5da95cda1cf69ceb179af70235550428926739f44762648cd3c21c9fc7204778",
      "translation_text_hash": "786317749ffab0910521d30dc603e3bcd5a15c22ba6cbea3a2a3a10ac23d660d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "도리어 내가 무할례자에게 복음 전함을 맡기를 베드로가 할례자에게 맡음과 같이 한 것을 보고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "786317749ffab0910521d30dc603e3bcd5a15c22ba6cbea3a2a3a10ac23d660d"
