      "en": "They only asked us to remember the poor—which very thing I was also zealous to do.",
      "ko": "다만 우리에게 가난한 자들 생각하는 것을 부탁하였으니 이것을 나도 본래 힘써 행하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "931ff6a96e9816177b419d14f8ab3030abb9c348b0b24fb66c2f7fd7bcb680f2",
      "translation_text_hash": "6a5286c786a1825a4a9b7ff053c3245edb759b796ee3d9ca98df96ed750af954",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
