      "en": "But when Peter came to Antioch, I resisted him to his face, because he stood condemned.",
      "ko": "게바가 안디옥에 이르렀을 때에 책망할 일이 있기로 내가 저를 면책하였노라",
      "source_text_hash": "69729e6237fcee873b970900855035f4894d06554120c6c86bbb344bf2b910e5",
      "translation_text_hash": "c0bcbccb1b4a0ecf699c68ad619fc4da4598ac5b192aab9d02f892af7b888eba",
