          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "For before some people came from James, he ate with the Gentiles. But when they came, he drew back and separated himself, fearing those who were of the circumcision.",
      "ko": "야고보에게서 온 어떤이들이 이르기 전에 게바가 이방인과 함께 먹다가 저희가 오매 그가 할례자들을 두려워하여 떠나 물러가매",
      "source_text_hash": "f560a9e4e1b09354de9a6961e7b812d6fa8669e6ad89151a8f9d40b36c370b9d",
      "translation_text_hash": "78c6e4247151457ecc914df32dc6e36c4efc70238a5b337619a7e3be19c207b0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
